    "body": "Relevant implementer thoughts:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/w3c/page-visibility/issues/39#issuecomment-389486782: Gecko thinks it should be fine, although we need to be careful about the unload algorithm, in particular impact on fullscreen.\r\n- https://github.com/w3c/page-visibility/issues/39#issuecomment-401484560 and elsehwere: Blink is game to try\r\n- No comments from EdgeHTML or WebKit.\r\n\r\nSo the biggest TODO is the concerns around unload.",
