    "created_at": "2020-09-28T00:05:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-28T05:08:14Z",
    "body": "> So I’d be happy to raise a PR or bug myself against the Page Visibility spec about this. Should I?\r\n\r\nThat would be great, thank you!\r\n\r\nAlthough, I think the part that @cdumez talked about in that comment is not related to unload (it's about recovering a document on bfcache/history traversal) which is already covered by  [session history document visibility change steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#session-history-document-visibility-change-steps)",
